tant term $30$ last:\n\n$$\n{{x}^{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{11}{2}x+{(\\frac{11}{2})}^{2}}_{⏟}-\\,{(\\frac{11}{2})}^{2}+30\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x-\\frac{11}{2})}^{2}-{(\\frac{11}{2})}^{2}+30\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n{(x-\\frac{11}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-223639/field-1" "q-223639/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1481d4a2-64b4-590a-9dbb-c39d3364bb59"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-223639"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection/3792120043a8882707d3d64119de4233bff96805b8909acf749eec44e5915a8d" :answer/id #uuid "12f13d37-e7e5-535d-bc7e-0b922a099d20" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x-\\frac{7}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{13}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection/9e0410a4acf2d471391df22b6a63cad8b1eaaab35e9416a4c394941b4d43cbe6" :answer/id #uuid "19fc12f6-8c8e-5f41-85c8-0bb0bff17c82" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x-\\frac{7}{2})}^{2}-11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection/a0408bf4d0bce5924ad66346e99bca587ee42f606622057092e4418a19ed3b93" :answer/id #uuid "977e1574-303f-5c92-aeb3-b807ebdfb28c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x+\\frac{7}{2})}^{2}-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection/8b7bdabcd57d94381e3c69da7711abb5db0e11e32c7bb0e0bafc6095fef44a7c" :answer/id #uuid "1377bf28-339b-52aa-8f98-67216edf94d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x-\\frac{7}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{45}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection/3b8e332e6cdc879828f59f4155f6c645913d7d854f0c29fa036d460f28c684a7" :answer/id #uuid "996b0042-15e7-5522-a6b5-f1bb7262e83b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x+\\frac{7}{2})}^{2}-\\frac{11}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140310/selection" :answer-field/i